      ("Tabla con intervalos", f"Doce estudiantes registraron sus minutos de lectura: {j(LECT)}. Agrúpalos en intervalos de ancho 10 que empiecen en 0.", [f"Intervalo 0–9: {in_bin(LECT, 0, 9)}; 10–19: {in_bin(LECT, 10, 19)}; 20–29: {in_bin(LECT, 20, 29)}; 30–39: {in_bin(LECT, 30, 39)}.", f"Comprueba el total: {in_bin(LECT, 0, 9)} + {in_bin(LECT, 10, 19)} + {in_bin(LECT, 20, 29)} + {in_bin(LECT, 30, 39)} = {len(LECT)}."], f"0–9: {in_bin(LECT, 0, 9)}, 10–19: {in_bin(LECT, 10, 19)}, 20–29: {in_bin(LECT, 20, 29)}, 30–39: {in_bin(LECT, 30, 39)}"),
